<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Kiss Me Goodbye</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;She begins with some simple drum warmups. Nothing more than practicing rudiments on different parts of the kit, and she runs through her limb independence exercises a few times before putting on her headphones to actually play something.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Then her fucking phone rings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Irked, she wipes the beads of sweat off of her brow and wonders who the fuck is bothering her. She knows itâ€™s not her moms. Her sister installed a light to the basement door thatâ€™s hooked up to a light switch upstairs. If they want to talk to her, theyâ€™d just flick that switch, the light would go on, and sheâ€™d put the sticks and headphones down and see what they wanted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She didnâ€™t expect to see the name Adora Greyskull on her screen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or&lt;br /&gt;Just before heading off to Juliard for college, Catra tries to patch things up with her ex. It goes as well as you might expect.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>DÃ¸c (d0c_save_us_all)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
